0ac044b44f39f91dce23b85.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 13895, "name": "Cateia Games", "slug": "cateia-games", "games_count": 19, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/abd/abd6803bcd3928bb78840a244e84a002.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Upon your arrival to the town, things get more and more mysterious and clouded. It's up to you to delve into the town's hidden mysteries and discover the truth. But first you'll need to understand the strange inhabitants.\nSome places look completely abandoned in this small, once peaceful town, while others, on the other hand, look like everything's normal. Little makes sense at first, but as you progress forward, talk to local folks, search for clues and hidden items and solve riddles and mini-games, a mystery will reveal in front of your eyes, piece by piece.\nAnd, are the ominous figures in black trying to help you, or are they leading you into certain peril? What lies beyond the elaborate labyrinth? Find out in this original and exciting hidden object adventure game!\n• EXCITING out-of-this-world ADVENTURE\n• FEELS like playing an interactive thriller novel\n• HELP the reporter Mary investigate the mysterious case\n• MEET enigmatic characters\n• EXPLORE the mystical town and its locations\n• VISIT dozens of places\n• FIND clues and solve RIDDLES\n• SEARCH for HIDDEN OBJECTS and items\n• SOLVE many different mini-games\n• USE GUIDED HINT and MAP for traveling\n• 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: casual, adventure, challenging"}